WEBVTT

00:00.587 --> 00:09.620
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.587 --> 00:09.620
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.907 --> 00:18.619
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.907 --> 00:18.618
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.699 --> 00:37.409
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.699 --> 00:37.409
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.636 --> 00:46.969
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.636 --> 00:46.970
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.061 --> 00:56.336
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.061 --> 00:56.337
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.496 --> 01:05.603
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.496 --> 01:05.603
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.847 --> 01:14.800
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.847 --> 01:14.801
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.892 --> 01:22.995
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.892 --> 01:22.995
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.928 --> 01:30.715
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.767 --> 01:33.938
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.978 --> 01:35.985
Black Jack.

02:50.846 --> 02:53.297
It paid off to camp out for two weeks,

02:53.724 --> 02:56.559
my dear Iriomote cat.

02:53.751 --> 02:56.505
The Iriomote cat is a nationally protected
wildlife species in Japan.

02:57.119 --> 03:02.053
Prologue

02:58.866 --> 03:02.053
The Order Of Operations

03:09.294 --> 03:11.003
It's so hot!

03:11.284 --> 03:13.529
Doc, aren't you hot?

03:14.207 --> 03:15.874
No, I'm fine.

03:20.546 --> 03:22.672
Your island is hot,

03:22.673 --> 03:25.550
but Nigirimote Island is hot too.

03:25.551 --> 03:26.843
It's Iriomote Island.

03:26.972 --> 03:29.638
Doc, are you really not hot?

03:29.639 --> 03:30.109
No.

03:30.970 --> 03:35.863
Uminekomaru, scheduled to depart
at 9:15, will be boarding shortly.

03:36.642 --> 03:39.910
All passengers should line up in two rows.

03:40.813 --> 03:43.440
See? It's a candy Kitty.

03:43.941 --> 03:45.316
Look at that man.

03:45.317 --> 03:47.694
He's wearing a black coat even in Okinawa.

03:47.695 --> 03:48.695
Really.

03:48.696 --> 03:50.572
Isn't he hot?

03:50.673 --> 03:52.639
He's not hot!

03:52.799 --> 03:53.586
He's with a kid?

03:53.766 --> 03:55.379
I'm not his kid!

03:55.744 --> 04:00.832
I am his wife.

04:01.146 --> 04:02.479
W-What's wrong with her?

04:02.573 --> 04:03.459
His wife?

04:03.836 --> 04:05.003
That's so stupid.

04:05.588 --> 04:07.464
What?! Stupid?!

04:07.465 --> 04:09.340
The one who says stupid is the stupid one!

04:10.009 --> 04:11.836
Pinoco! Don't mind them.

04:11.911 --> 04:12.928
But...

04:13.262 --> 04:15.044
Okay, clear the way.

04:15.389 --> 04:16.931
Here, this way.

04:16.932 --> 04:18.658
Sir, you are the V.I.P.

04:18.851 --> 04:20.101
I see, I see!

04:21.638 --> 04:26.149
Senator, the purpose of your visit today is
for land development for a resort, right?

04:27.147 --> 04:30.279
Yes, this will be a good resort island.

04:29.653 --> 04:31.433
What's the matter with that guy?!

04:31.476 --> 04:33.775
We've been in line all this time!

04:33.949 --> 04:34.991
Cheater!

04:35.493 --> 04:37.744
Uminekomaru is departing.

04:39.455 --> 04:40.102
Wait!

04:40.372 --> 04:41.456
Wait!

04:41.457 --> 04:42.165
Let me on!

04:42.166 --> 04:43.482
I'm getting on too!

04:42.666 --> 04:43.583
It's dangerous!

04:44.168 --> 04:45.977
Sir, please don't do that.

04:46.170 --> 04:47.796
Sorry.

04:48.471 --> 04:50.215
Man, it's hot.

04:50.633 --> 04:52.926
Takashi, the ship has started moving.

05:00.267 --> 05:03.478
Doc, you really love this island.

05:04.772 --> 05:08.363
Iriomote Island is a beautiful island with
mountains and tropical forests,

05:08.567 --> 05:10.930
filled with nationally protected wildlife.

05:12.154 --> 05:16.954
In 1972, the majority of the island
was designated as a national park.

05:17.326 --> 05:19.141
National park?

05:19.578 --> 05:22.647
It means the forest is protected by the government.

05:24.083 --> 05:25.508
For now...

05:32.216 --> 05:36.988
Senator Tanaka, can we really expect
a resort on Iriomote Island?

05:38.431 --> 05:39.264
Leave it all to me!

05:39.723 --> 05:43.302
I'm betting my life on the development
of a resort on this island.

05:43.654 --> 05:45.145
Just watch.

05:45.146 --> 05:48.731
Iriomote Island will soon become the best resort.

05:49.250 --> 05:52.029
But, Senator, what about the environmental issues?

05:52.153 --> 05:53.611
Are you kidding me?!

05:54.113 --> 05:56.197
Aren't you a local person?

05:56.615 --> 05:58.849
Lots of money's gonna flow into your homeland.

05:59.618 --> 06:01.176
You should thank me!

06:02.449 --> 06:05.730
Don't worry, I have other connections too.

06:05.916 --> 06:08.857
We can get more development next year.

06:09.717 --> 06:13.423
Yes, sir, you always think about the
citizens first and foremost...

06:13.424 --> 06:14.841
I'm thirsty.

06:15.009 --> 06:16.259
I will bring some water, right away.

06:16.270 --> 06:17.218
No, wine!

06:17.219 --> 06:18.386
Bring me some wine.

06:18.474 --> 06:18.970
Yes, sir.

06:19.770 --> 06:22.724
I just love wine.

06:22.730 --> 06:24.228
Is he some politician?

06:24.393 --> 06:25.460
Looks like it.

06:25.895 --> 06:27.645
How rude of him.

06:27.693 --> 06:29.183
Shh! He'll hear you.

06:29.398 --> 06:30.378
It's okay.

06:30.608 --> 06:31.858
We'll be there soon.

06:31.901 --> 06:32.901
Hey, bring it faster!

06:32.902 --> 06:33.727
Yes, right away.

06:42.881 --> 06:46.655
Ladies and gentlemen, the ship
may sway due to the waves.

06:46.868 --> 06:50.215
Please remain in your seats...

06:47.958 --> 06:50.215
Okay, sir, are you ready?

06:55.257 --> 06:57.634
A glass of wine on the blue ocean.

06:57.635 --> 06:58.913
'Tis the taste of...

06:59.136 --> 06:59.719
What?

07:00.429 --> 07:01.933
The mood is ruined!

07:02.348 --> 07:04.432
We're in the middle of an interview, so keep it quiet!

07:05.059 --> 07:06.046
I'm sorry.

07:06.435 --> 07:09.729
Oh, they're so.annoying.

07:09.730 --> 07:10.688
Right, Doc?

07:13.150 --> 07:15.235
Now, Sir, drink up!

07:15.628 --> 07:17.028
Oh, no way!

07:17.029 --> 07:18.363
I'm serious!

07:20.783 --> 07:21.991
What's wrong with that?

07:22.451 --> 07:24.160
The package jumped!

07:25.809 --> 07:26.901
Hey, man.

07:28.582 --> 07:29.296
Your package!

07:29.750 --> 07:31.167
It's moving!

07:31.877 --> 07:32.418
Damn!

07:33.254 --> 07:34.657
The anesthetic ran out.

07:34.996 --> 07:37.382
Hey, what's in it?

07:38.259 --> 07:39.382
Nothing.

07:40.052 --> 07:41.922
It's really nothing.

07:43.180 --> 07:44.472
I have to put it to sleep again.

07:50.295 --> 07:51.461
What? A cat?

07:51.689 --> 07:52.970
Who brought it on?

07:54.567 --> 07:55.525
Don't come this way!

07:58.486 --> 07:59.681
Hurry to the rear seats!

08:00.239 --> 08:00.655
Captain!

08:05.202 --> 08:06.200
Doc!

08:05.536 --> 08:06.244
Pinoco!

08:26.682 --> 08:28.876
Captain, where's the cat?

08:29.184 --> 08:30.162
I don't know.

08:30.447 --> 08:32.103
Anyway, contact the mainland via radio.

08:32.396 --> 08:33.313
Yes.

08:34.413 --> 08:36.399
This is Uminekomaru. Uminekomaru!

08:36.400 --> 08:37.473
Please come in.

08:37.818 --> 08:38.683
This is Uminekomaru.

08:38.903 --> 08:39.360
This is...

08:40.696 --> 08:42.280
Drats, water got in it.

08:42.781 --> 08:44.735
Captain, the radio is down.

08:44.909 --> 08:45.951
It's not working.

08:46.410 --> 08:47.285
Same here.

08:47.286 --> 08:48.995
The propeller got broken by the rocks.

08:48.277 --> 08:49.670
Hey, we've got people wounded!

08:50.205 --> 08:51.908
Senator! Are you okay?!

08:52.082 --> 08:53.685
Please hang on!

08:52.717 --> 08:53.717
It hurts!

08:53.917 --> 08:56.002
I'm gonna die!

08:56.295 --> 08:57.212
Takashi!

08:57.838 --> 08:58.922
Takashi!

08:59.075 --> 09:00.066
Are you okay?

09:00.168 --> 09:01.624
What are you doing?!

09:01.800 --> 09:03.855
Take him to a hospital immediately!

09:04.178 --> 09:07.096
But we are unable to move right now.

09:07.681 --> 09:08.681
What?!

09:08.682 --> 09:10.268
Then when will the rescue team be here?

09:10.309 --> 09:12.571
But the radio is inoperable too.

09:12.788 --> 09:14.297
Don't kid me!

09:14.688 --> 09:16.342
My senator is injured!

09:17.315 --> 09:20.437
Is there a doctor here?

09:20.684 --> 09:22.741
Doc, they want you.

09:23.104 --> 09:24.424
Hey, Doc!

09:24.698 --> 09:26.783
They want a doctor!

09:27.058 --> 09:28.295
Is there anyone?

09:29.065 --> 09:31.044
Or any nurse?

09:30.199 --> 09:31.014
Yes!

09:31.247 --> 09:32.417
There is one here!

09:32.706 --> 09:33.530
Over here!

09:34.124 --> 09:36.543
Pinoco, don't do that.

09:36.794 --> 09:39.777
Aren't you going to save the injured?

09:40.214 --> 09:42.715
I just don't want to get involved in any trouble.

09:43.300 --> 09:44.898
Are you a doctor?

09:45.386 --> 09:48.221
Yes, he sure is one.

09:49.014 --> 09:51.316
He owns an island around here,

09:51.531 --> 09:53.393
and he comes around every two to three months.

09:53.394 --> 09:54.769
He's a surgeon.

09:54.996 --> 09:56.521
Good!

09:56.522 --> 09:59.232
Would you quickly take a look at him?

09:59.749 --> 10:00.459
Doctor?

10:00.736 --> 10:01.421
Doctor?

10:03.102 --> 10:05.132
I'm not a proper doctor.

10:06.198 --> 10:09.972
You mean, unlicensed?

10:10.834 --> 10:14.133
But does it matter now?

10:14.707 --> 10:15.849
You're right.

10:16.359 --> 10:19.173
Please, Doctor, save him!

10:21.948 --> 10:23.156
Where are the injured?

10:31.877 --> 10:33.660
That's a serious injury!

10:34.755 --> 10:36.172
There are two injured.

10:36.882 --> 10:40.220
A one year old baby and Senator Tanaka.

10:40.786 --> 10:43.263
Hey, you're the one who cut in line earlier!

10:43.264 --> 10:45.473
Please administer first aid before we get to shore.

10:45.766 --> 10:48.476
Doctor, please save him.

10:48.606 --> 10:49.239
You! Come here!

10:49.333 --> 10:51.242
Treat me first, please!

10:51.716 --> 10:53.289
I don't want to die here!

10:54.325 --> 10:55.830
I'll pay whatever.

10:56.068 --> 10:57.412
Captain, I found the cat.

10:57.439 --> 10:57.965
What?

10:57.999 --> 10:58.868
Look.

10:59.196 --> 11:01.031
It's nearly dead.

11:01.073 --> 11:02.001
What is that?

11:03.367 --> 11:03.993
That's...

11:04.726 --> 11:06.168
That's an Iriomote cat!

11:07.788 --> 11:10.569
Who brought an Iriomote cat on this ship?!

11:11.083 --> 11:11.561
Who?!

11:13.266 --> 11:14.377
He did it!

11:14.378 --> 11:16.044
The cat came out of his luggage!

11:16.797 --> 11:18.298
You must be a poacher.

11:20.384 --> 11:23.678
You caught it, fully aware that it's red-marked?!

11:20.384 --> 11:23.678
red-marked = protected species

11:24.263 --> 11:26.036
Hey, what are you doing?

11:26.071 --> 11:27.545
Forget about the cat!

11:28.100 --> 11:29.990
Come quick and treat me!

11:30.394 --> 11:32.830
Doctor, please treat him.

11:34.273 --> 11:36.572
My fee is not cheap.

11:37.068 --> 11:37.901
Are you sure?

11:38.277 --> 11:41.404
I told you, I'll pay whatever you want!

11:41.852 --> 11:42.784
I see.

11:43.332 --> 11:47.869
Then, Senator, I will take 10,000,000 for your first aid.

11:48.871 --> 11:50.288
10,000,000?!

11:51.068 --> 11:53.361
And 10,000,000 for your baby too.

11:53.970 --> 11:56.211
N-no way...

11:56.796 --> 11:57.846
That's crazy.

11:58.172 --> 11:59.589
Is he really a doctor?

12:00.299 --> 12:02.384
If you don't pay, then I won't do it.

12:04.050 --> 12:04.965
Fine.

12:05.179 --> 12:07.984
I will talk it over with my husband, and we will pay!

12:08.391 --> 12:09.599
So please save him!

12:09.850 --> 12:11.913
Damn, you're trying to take advantage of us!

12:12.061 --> 12:13.853
I'll pay!

12:14.835 --> 12:15.501
Yes.

12:15.981 --> 12:16.992
Then I'll do it.

12:17.566 --> 12:18.775
But, under one condition.

12:19.615 --> 12:22.570
You can never complain about what I do.

12:23.146 --> 12:23.738
Got it?

12:24.782 --> 12:25.421
Fine.

12:25.700 --> 12:26.741
Get started now.

12:27.159 --> 12:28.573
Move the injured to the front seats!

12:28.995 --> 12:31.204
Everyone else, move to the back of the boat!

12:37.545 --> 12:38.962
What's your baby's blood type?

12:38.963 --> 12:40.547
It's type O.

12:40.548 --> 12:41.339
Rh?

12:40.548 --> 12:41.316
Rh = Rhesus factor

12:41.340 --> 12:42.007
It's positive.

12:42.550 --> 12:45.441
Captain, find a blood donor with type O!

12:45.441 --> 12:45.969
Yes.

12:46.637 --> 12:48.930
Ma'am, would you hold the baby still?

12:49.348 --> 12:50.576
This is a partial anesthetic.

12:50.683 --> 12:51.891
This will stop the pain.

12:52.143 --> 12:54.754
Hey, treat me now!

12:55.062 --> 12:55.645
Hey!

12:55.646 --> 12:56.354
Shut up!

12:57.109 --> 12:58.109
What?

12:58.524 --> 13:01.271
Look, I only have two arms.

13:01.610 --> 13:04.529
I don't want you to tell me what to do with my arms.

13:04.916 --> 13:08.033
I paid you 10,000,000 with my check.

13:08.034 --> 13:09.450
Doc!
I'm the only one who paid!

13:09.535 --> 13:11.118
We found one.

13:11.746 --> 13:14.149
Doctor, he's the only type O.

13:14.373 --> 13:16.393
Take responsibility for yourself, and cooperate with us.

13:16.834 --> 13:18.310
Pinoco, get ready for a blood transfusion.

13:18.544 --> 13:20.837
Aye aye, sir!

13:20.838 --> 13:23.582
Hey! How about 20,000,000?

13:23.924 --> 13:26.259
Will you treat me first with 20,000,000?

13:26.844 --> 13:28.720
Oh, 20,000,000?

13:28.976 --> 13:30.836
Don't just stand there!

13:30.983 --> 13:31.936
Write the check!

13:31.936 --> 13:32.974
Y-Yes.

13:33.376 --> 13:34.735
I'll get the money ready...

13:36.896 --> 13:38.271
Hey! What are you doing?!

13:40.316 --> 13:43.610
Are you treating the cat before me?!

13:44.779 --> 13:49.134
Is the life of a beast more important than my life?!

13:49.492 --> 13:51.117
Are you insane?!

13:51.702 --> 13:53.013
Quit your whining!

13:53.371 --> 13:54.735
I told you this is my condition.

13:55.081 --> 13:56.873
Don't complain about what I do!

13:57.208 --> 13:58.400
Cut the crap!

13:58.709 --> 14:00.635
Throw that beast into the sea!

14:00.795 --> 14:02.619
Treat me right now!

14:02.837 --> 14:04.881
Or else I will sue you!

14:05.508 --> 14:08.843
If you have enough energy to scream that much,
your injury is obviously not that serious.

14:09.283 --> 14:11.265
You damn quack!

14:11.343 --> 14:13.297
Son of a bitch!

14:12.890 --> 14:14.521
The artery is not broken.

14:15.237 --> 14:16.393
I can save him.

14:21.190 --> 14:22.447
Good, I'm done.

14:22.736 --> 14:24.526
I'm glad for you.

14:25.929 --> 14:26.929
Get well.

14:27.264 --> 14:28.403
Pinoco, are you ready?

14:29.103 --> 14:29.689
I'm okay.

14:29.689 --> 14:30.523
Hey.

14:31.117 --> 14:33.999
The cat first, and then the baby, huh?

14:35.121 --> 14:37.468
And I, the senator, am last.

14:37.873 --> 14:41.042
Damn, I'll sue you if you get to me too late!

14:41.711 --> 14:44.671
Ma'am, you may faint, so you'd better not watch.

14:44.672 --> 14:45.255
Okay.

14:45.881 --> 14:48.758
Doctor, please save my Takashi.

14:49.135 --> 14:49.797
I know.

14:51.804 --> 14:53.128
Pinoco, scalpel.

14:53.455 --> 14:54.180
Here.

14:55.402 --> 14:57.162
The radial nerve is cut.

14:55.402 --> 14:57.162
The radial nerve governs the movement
and sensation of arms and fingers

14:57.775 --> 14:58.908
This is difficult.

14:58.978 --> 15:00.145
What do we do?

15:01.772 --> 15:03.328
We have to sew these nerves together.

15:03.983 --> 15:06.484
I just hope there won't be any big sways.

15:08.487 --> 15:10.697
Please don't sway.

15:20.291 --> 15:22.375
He shouldn't have any paralysis in his arm.

15:23.230 --> 15:24.157
Doctor!

15:24.879 --> 15:27.579
However, it's just first aid.

15:27.882 --> 15:29.966
Get him to a hospital quickly, and have another operation.

15:30.176 --> 15:31.284
Thank you.

15:32.090 --> 15:32.760
Takashi!

15:34.086 --> 15:35.638
Now, mister Senator.

15:36.599 --> 15:38.694
It's your turn now.

15:42.271 --> 15:43.980
Why did you do the cat first?

15:44.690 --> 15:48.178
Because it's a nationally protected species
that is on the verge of extinction.

15:48.694 --> 15:51.946
On the.other hand, you're not on the verge of extinction.

15:52.365 --> 15:54.421
I handed you 10,000,000!

15:54.622 --> 15:55.909
On the other hand, the cat didn't...

15:56.577 --> 15:59.371
Do you really think a cat can pay 10,000,000?

15:59.997 --> 16:01.354
Your injury is really nothing.

16:01.791 --> 16:03.828
It's only cut down to the rectus abdominus.

16:04.377 --> 16:06.878
You have so much fat it hat it saved you.

16:09.173 --> 16:10.910
You got lucky.

16:12.452 --> 16:13.759
Lucky?!

16:14.762 --> 16:17.013
You'd better not yap too much for your own sake.

16:16.606 --> 16:17.899
Attention passengers.

16:18.772 --> 16:22.394
The radio is functional again, and we
were able to contact the mainland.

16:23.089 --> 16:25.709
The rescue team will be here momentarily.

16:26.416 --> 16:27.151
Repeating

16:27.570 --> 16:29.362
The radio is functional again, and we
were able to contact the mainland.

16:29.683 --> 16:31.148
Yeah!

16:31.198 --> 16:31.879
Ouch...

16:31.904 --> 16:34.652
The rescue team will be here soon.

16:32.446 --> 16:34.910
Damn quack, just watch.

16:34.991 --> 16:36.574
I'll get you.

16:41.784 --> 16:43.999
Prosecutor, he's all yours.

16:44.653 --> 16:50.060
You had three seriously injured, one
citizen, one baby, and one cat.

16:50.299 --> 16:57.366
Why did you decide to treat them in
the order of cat, baby, then citizen?

16:58.139 --> 17:02.094
After inspecting all three injuries,
Senator Tanaka's was the least serious,

17:02.435 --> 17:04.791
and the Iriomote cat's was the most serious injury.

17:05.646 --> 17:09.837
That's why I treated the one who was
most severely injured, first - the cat.

17:10.443 --> 17:11.877
That is all.

17:12.236 --> 17:16.397
Are you telling me that you see humans
and animals as being equal?

17:17.241 --> 17:20.242
Is that how you operate as a doctor?

17:21.489 --> 17:22.244
Yes.

17:22.704 --> 17:25.331
Not only did you operate without a license,

17:25.665 --> 17:31.189
but you left a dying patient, and treated an animal first.

17:31.422 --> 17:35.898
Such an action is abnormal and inhumane.

17:36.427 --> 17:38.698
I demand maximum punishment upon the defendant.

17:40.514 --> 17:41.418
Case closed.

17:42.350 --> 17:43.178
Doctor.

17:44.810 --> 17:47.687
Doctor, thank you very much for the other day.

17:48.522 --> 17:51.149
At the hospital, they told me that your aid was miraculous.

17:51.617 --> 17:53.633
He is recovering just fine, too.

17:54.028 --> 17:55.111
Thank you very much.

17:59.241 --> 18:02.346
Mr. Quack, you're now done for.

18:03.829 --> 18:04.493
Please take this.

18:05.831 --> 18:06.831
What is this?

18:07.625 --> 18:10.126
It is your medical record that I composed.

18:10.836 --> 18:13.713
I don't need any record from a quack
who'd treat a cat before me!

18:14.173 --> 18:15.120
Take your pick.

18:15.633 --> 18:18.825
Either you read the record and live
on, or you don't and you die.

18:19.220 --> 18:20.679
It's your choice.

18:20.680 --> 18:21.574
What?!

18:22.139 --> 18:24.590
You gave me 10,000,000 yen, after all.

18:24.934 --> 18:26.367
I made ran official record for you.

18:26.727 --> 18:29.521
When I checked your peritoneum, you had tumors.

18:26.727 --> 18:29.521
The peritoneum is the thin membrane
that lines the abdominal cavity.

18:29.814 --> 18:31.954
It looked like some peas thrown around.

18:32.134 --> 18:32.997
W-What?!

18:35.277 --> 18:37.320
You must have cancer in your large intestine somewhere,

18:37.989 --> 18:40.286
and that must be spreading the
cancer cells around your body.

18:41.701 --> 18:42.550
Cancer?!

18:43.494 --> 18:45.823
You'd better stop threatening me with lies!

18:46.122 --> 18:49.228
If you think I'm lying, then go check it out in a hospital.

18:52.962 --> 18:54.421
Senator...

18:55.089 --> 18:58.982
It's a really complicated case. Your
chance of survival is very slim.

18:59.760 --> 19:02.387
But I can save you.

19:03.210 --> 19:05.126
If you don't want to believe me, that's fine.

19:05.683 --> 19:08.021
If you believe me, then come see me anytime.

19:13.613 --> 19:15.595
Wow, Doc! Welcome home!

19:15.753 --> 19:16.943
Were you pardoned?

19:17.570 --> 19:18.236
Certainly not.

19:18.237 --> 19:18.998
I was only released on bail.

19:19.205 --> 19:20.905
Oh, darn.

19:21.324 --> 19:24.868
I thought we could celebrate you being found not guilty.

19:25.244 --> 19:30.373
But, anyway, you always celebrate with
curry, no matter what the case may be.

19:30.579 --> 19:33.335
So, why. did you treat the cat?

19:34.045 --> 19:38.749
The Iriomote cat is almost extinct on Iriomote Island.

19:39.133 --> 19:41.301
There are only one hundred or so of them.

19:41.537 --> 19:43.928
One hundred? That's all?!

19:44.374 --> 19:44.997
That's right.

19:45.639 --> 19:47.724
But there are plenty of politicians.

19:48.434 --> 19:52.520
And on top of that, Iriomote Island will
eventually be changed and destroyed.

20:00.946 --> 20:02.454
Hey, Senator Tanaka!

20:03.449 --> 20:04.699
You want me to operate on you?

20:05.826 --> 20:07.309
I have a few conditions.

20:08.037 --> 20:09.420
No, not money.

20:09.622 --> 20:11.668
First, withdraw the case against me.

20:12.014 --> 20:16.072
And second, withdraw your plans for Iriomote Island.

20:16.420 --> 20:19.757
If you can guarantee those two, I will operate on you.

20:20.387 --> 20:21.404
Bull shit!

20:21.634 --> 20:23.635
If you refuse, then I won't do it.

20:25.306 --> 20:27.597
Yes, that's right.

20:31.352 --> 20:32.936
Yay!

20:35.523 --> 20:37.232
Doc got pardoned.

20:37.233 --> 20:38.900
Let's celebrate!

20:39.235 --> 20:43.217
My cooking is yummy, so you can eat all you want!

20:43.447 --> 20:46.489
Then I'll make you more yummy stuff.

20:56.669 --> 20:57.377
Pinoco.

20:57.962 --> 20:58.916
Hey, Pinoco!

20:59.722 --> 21:02.090
Ohmigewdness!

21:02.466 --> 21:03.101
Pinoco!

21:03.379 --> 21:06.115
It's best for him to live here.

21:06.762 --> 21:07.498
Understand that?

21:16.731 --> 21:21.067
If your want to stay with me, you can.

21:24.783 --> 21:25.947
He's gone.

21:27.352 --> 21:31.473
Have lots of kids!

21:38.336 --> 21:39.831
Don't be so sulky, Pinoco.

21:40.469 --> 21:42.079
Here, have this.

21:45.634 --> 21:48.199
I'm not a kid!

21:49.221 --> 21:50.086
Oh yeah?

21:50.723 --> 21:52.015
You don't want it?

21:55.896 --> 21:57.605
You still want it, don't you?

21:58.314 --> 22:00.940
Oh, Doc, you meanie!

22:07.041 --> 22:18.978
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.041 --> 22:18.996
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.114 --> 22:24.113
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.114 --> 22:24.113
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.755 --> 22:30.888
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.755 --> 22:30.888
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.768 --> 22:36.942
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.768 --> 22:36.941
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.764 --> 22:40.277
being heated up by you,

22:37.764 --> 22:40.277
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.458 --> 22:48.304
so much that I change color

22:40.458 --> 22:48.304
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.344 --> 23:00.226
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.344 --> 23:00.226
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.246 --> 23:11.948
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.246 --> 23:11.948
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.321 --> 23:23.539
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.321 --> 23:23.539
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.821 --> 23:28.646
I couldn't be happier

23:23.821 --> 23:28.646
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.874 --> 23:33.808
How does it taste?

23:28.874 --> 23:33.807
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.575 --> 23:47.187
Pinoco's diary...

23:48.654 --> 23:52.787
That's why I treated the one who was
most severely injured, first - the cat.

23:53.561 --> 23:54.561
That is all.
